      "review_summary": "The PR centralizes truncated response-prefix decoding, exports `readResponseTextPrefix` from the Plugin SDK runtime subpath, and migrates core/provider/web/memory/Voice/SMS/ChatGPT diagnostic readers plus tests.\n\nPR surface: Source -136, Tests +133, Generated 0. Total -3 across 23 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main flushes byte-capped `TextDecoder` state, and a focused Node probe shows a 3-byte prefix of `ab😀cd` decodes as `ab�` unless streaming decode is used. I did not run a full provider or channel flow.",
